  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.7.0:\n      - Adds explicit parameterized projections and parameterized projection registry APIs.\n      - Adds deterministic projection plan export for CI-friendly review.\n      - Adds projection diagnostics for raw public IDs and secure ID infrastructure in query expressions.\n      - Expands EF Core projection validation reports with provider metadata and parameter sample support.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
